# Scratch vs instruments.
#   scripts/ is disposable scratch: ignored, may be deleted at any time.
#   probes/  is tracked: anything a document cites lives there, so the
#            measurement can be re-run from a clean checkout.
# tests/unit/test_cited_instruments_are_tracked.py enforces this — it reads
# every docs/*REMEDIATION*.md and fails if a cited harness is not tracked.
scripts/*
!scripts/backfill_paying_wallet_assets.py
!scripts/backfill_idea_validation_outcomes.py
# Cited by docs/IDEA_AUDIENCE_SCORING_REMEDIATION.md; belongs in probes/, but
# that ledger is owned elsewhere. Un-ignored so the citation still resolves.
!scripts/stated_audience_floor_ab.py
node_modules

# mutmut's sandbox: a full copy of the tree it mutates (~70MB), regenerated by
# `make mutation` and disposable — `make mutation-clean` deletes it. It sits at the
# repo root, so without this a `git add -A` stages the whole thing.
mutants/
.mutmut-cache
